# The raw downloads never go in git.
#
# aei_claude_ai_*.csv is 219 MB and GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100 MB.
# A push containing it fails, and worse, it fails AFTER the commit exists, so
# you end up rewriting history to get rid of it.
#
# build.py filters these down to the few MB that actually matter, and THOSE
# go in git. Anyone can rebuild the raw files with fetch.sh.
raw/
